  "solution": {
    "text": "Given equation is<br /><math><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math><br />Which is a parabola as <math><mi>a</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.<br />"
  }
